uns and expressions like <span class=\"italic\">life-changing</span> or<span class=\"italic\"> Did you know that</span> \u2026 ? to describe key life events.<br> You use an expression like <span class=\"italic\">someday</span> to talk about a life event in the future. You cannot be sure about it.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Event\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"first day of school/work<br> birthday<br> graduation<br> getting a job<br> promotion<br> wedding<br> having a baby<br> anniversary (10th/25th)<br> retiring<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"memorable<br> eventful<br> life-changing<br> Did you know that \u2026 ?<br> I/it was so \u2026<br> When was the last time \u2026 ?<br> someday\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The challenge was memorable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It was a life-changing experience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Did you know that it was the first time I ever capsized a boat?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The race was so eventful!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "One for the history books! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm going to get a promotion someday!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "One for the history books! ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you remember all your life ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The race was so fun! One for the history books!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about a life event.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "life-changing ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very important; an event that changes your life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The River Challenge was a life-changing experience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "scared ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "afraid ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was scared when the boat capsized.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "eventful", "type": "name"}, {"content": "exciting; something that keeps you busy ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The race was eventful. So many things happened!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "memorable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you remember for a long time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The trip was memorable!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bond ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become very close to someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The tour group bonded during the race.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of 3 events that are very important in your life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2-3 sentences for each event.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell your partner about them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner talk about his or her key life events.